693135\" width=800 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out Mascots like Vanessa, a candle-wielding cupcake with a fiery attitude! Or go back to the stone age with Lil' Chomper, a T-Rex Mascot who may or may not have laser eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mascot Mayhem is in Early Access. The game is in a fun and playable state, but it is not content complete. The current state of the game is:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer for up to 4 players <strong>(you will need 1 or more controllers to play the game. One player may choose to use keyboard controls).</strong> We recommend playing with 4 players! <strong>The game works great with Steam Remote Play!</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect performance issues and bugs. The dojo, where you will be able to see gameplay stats, is not yet accessible. We plan to fix these issues, as well as create new characters, items, maps, and game modes throughout Early Access.\u00a0</strong></p>","developers":["Cherry Bomb Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427070/e5f0ce07655baa7ea10edb73935d5497392b06ff/header.jpg?t=1752693135","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1427070/1360942696/a72917fc2e89a